1
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:35,280
Move, move, move!

2
00:01:41,800 --> 00:01:43,760
Staff Officer Liang, what's going on?

3
00:01:44,120 --> 00:01:45,000
Is this an emergency assembly?

4
00:01:46,960 --> 00:01:48,120
Staff Officer Liang! Staff Officer Liang!

5
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:16,040
Reporting.

6
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:17,840
Speak. What is it?

7
00:02:20,880 --> 00:02:22,040
Reporting, Battalion Commander.

8
00:02:22,240 --> 00:02:24,440
Wu Dongsheng is a Squad Leader in the 1st Battalion,

9
00:02:24,440 --> 00:02:26,360
not just the Squad Leader of the Reconnaissance Squad.

10
00:02:27,480 --> 00:02:28,440
What do you mean?

11
00:02:28,760 --> 00:02:30,240
The backbone of every company in the battalion

12
00:02:30,240 --> 00:02:32,160
were mostly trained by Squad Leader Wu.

13
00:02:32,640 --> 00:02:35,440
This even includes several company and platoon officers.

14
00:02:48,040 --> 00:02:49,240
So what?

15
00:02:49,320 --> 00:02:50,920
Squad Leader Wu needs a blood transfusion.

16
00:02:50,920 --> 00:02:52,280
A lot of people can donate blood.

17
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:54,200
Li Songwei, I have no time for your nonsense.

18
00:02:54,200 --> 00:02:55,360
Just spit it out.

19
00:02:55,440 --> 00:02:56,440
If that's the case,

20
00:02:56,840 --> 00:02:58,920
everyone should pitch in and donate blood.

21
00:02:59,200 --> 00:03:00,840
Even drawing straws would be fine.

22
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:04,400
Why only draw blood from the Reconnaissance Squad?

23
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:06,880
It's not fair!

24
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:09,320
It's not fair!

25
00:03:10,480 --> 00:03:13,080
It's not fair!

26
00:03:35,040 --> 00:03:35,800
Wu Dongsheng,

27
00:03:37,200 --> 00:03:38,520
kid, your time as a soldier,

28
00:03:40,240 --> 00:03:41,320
has been truly worth it.

29
00:03:43,200 --> 00:03:43,960
Comrades,

30
00:03:44,680 --> 00:03:46,240
since it's come to this,

31
00:03:47,760 --> 00:03:49,600
the Battalion Commander and I can't hide it from you anymore.

32
00:03:51,240 --> 00:03:52,280
Comrade Wu Dongsheng,

33
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:54,640
indeed, due to

34
00:03:55,200 --> 00:03:56,280
severe blood loss,

35
00:03:57,360 --> 00:03:58,280
and coupled with...

36
00:04:01,200 --> 00:04:02,120
coupled with...

37
00:04:03,560 --> 00:04:05,200
he had to undergo an amputation.

38
00:04:06,200 --> 00:04:07,040
So...

39
00:04:07,360 --> 00:04:08,000
it's true.

40
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:09,160
Who got an amputation?

41
00:04:10,640 --> 00:04:12,560
Squad Leader Wu has iron feet.

42
00:04:12,600 --> 00:04:13,840
An amputation is impossible!

43
00:04:22,040 --> 00:04:23,040
Doctor Chen!

44
00:04:23,160 --> 00:04:24,080
Doctor Chen!

45
00:04:24,080 --> 00:04:24,720
Huzi!

46
00:04:24,920 --> 00:04:26,400
Did the Political Instructor misspeak?

47
00:04:26,400 --> 00:04:27,840
There must be a mistake!

48
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:32,360
Calm down. Calm down! Calm down! Calm down!

49
00:04:38,200 --> 00:04:39,040
Comrades!

50
00:04:42,320 --> 00:04:44,920
I, Guo Zijian, have been in the army for over ten years,

51
00:04:45,520 --> 00:04:46,920
but I've never seen a scene like this.

52
00:04:49,520 --> 00:04:51,440
You've all taught me a lesson today.

53
00:04:52,680 --> 00:04:56,240
You showed me what Comradeship truly is.

54
00:04:59,960 --> 00:05:01,560
They say, "Soldiers come and go,

55
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:02,640
but the barracks remain."

56
00:05:04,480 --> 00:05:06,120
But while soldiers may leave,

57
00:05:07,240 --> 00:05:10,480
this bond will never fade.

58
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:12,360
Instead, it will endure even longer.

59
00:05:15,640 --> 00:05:17,080
On behalf of Wu Dongsheng,

60
00:05:18,080 --> 00:05:19,680
and more so for myself,

61
00:05:20,360 --> 00:05:21,680
thank you all.

62
00:05:57,880 --> 00:05:59,560
Wu Dongsheng does indeed have

63
00:06:01,160 --> 00:06:02,240
AB blood.

64
00:06:03,200 --> 00:06:04,160
Theoretically speaking,

65
00:06:05,600 --> 00:06:08,400
most officers and soldiers in the battalion can donate blood to him.

66
00:06:09,960 --> 00:06:11,440
But if we're talking about fairness,

67
00:06:12,560 --> 00:06:14,840
the one who should roll up his sleeve the most

68
00:06:14,880 --> 00:06:16,280
is me, Guo Zijian.

69
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:18,760
Even if it means draining all my blood.

70
00:06:21,520 --> 00:06:23,560
Because Wu Dongsheng, from start to finish,

71
00:06:24,880 --> 00:06:27,000
was following my personal orders.

72
00:06:27,160 --> 00:06:29,280
Wu Dongsheng is a soldier in my 1st Company.

73
00:06:29,640 --> 00:06:30,560
This responsibility

74
00:06:30,680 --> 00:06:32,960
should be borne by me, as Company Commander.

75
00:06:38,680 --> 00:06:40,640
Thank you for trying to absolve me,

76
00:06:41,680 --> 00:06:43,440
but facts are facts.

77
00:06:44,520 --> 00:06:45,640
Regarding what happened to Wu Dongsheng,

78
00:06:45,880 --> 00:06:47,240
I cannot escape the blame.

79
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:54,640
Just now, the Political Instructor said

80
00:06:55,520 --> 00:06:57,600
Wu Dongsheng's service as a soldier was worth it.

81
00:06:58,120 --> 00:06:59,200
I want to say

82
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:02,240
that no matter what happens to Wu Dongsheng in the future,

83
00:07:02,440 --> 00:07:05,840
he will always be our 1st Battalion's Reconnaissance Squad leader.

84
00:07:14,680 --> 00:07:16,120
As for the blood donation,

85
00:07:17,800 --> 00:07:19,160
I ask you all to

86
00:07:19,680 --> 00:07:22,320
follow orders and obey commands.

87
00:07:25,440 --> 00:07:27,280
No matter whose blood

88
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:29,480
flows in Squad Leader Wu's veins in the future,

89
00:07:30,680 --> 00:07:31,360
I believe

90
00:07:32,280 --> 00:07:33,760
he will definitely feel it.

91
00:07:35,600 --> 00:07:37,200
Because this is the blood of

92
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:39,360
every comrade in the 1st Battalion,

93
00:07:40,440 --> 00:07:43,640
a precious gift from every comrade in the 1st Battalion.

94
00:07:47,880 --> 00:07:49,280
As for the problems in this exercise,

95
00:07:50,760 --> 00:07:51,760
the responsibility lies with me.

96
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:55,760
But I hope everyone

97
00:07:55,840 --> 00:07:58,080
doesn't lose the conviction to win.

98
00:07:58,920 --> 00:08:00,000
And doesn't lose

99
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:02,200
the 1st Battalion's spirit.

100
00:08:02,560 --> 00:08:03,960
Our Red 1st Battalion

101
00:08:04,440 --> 00:08:07,600
never faltered on the Long March.

102
00:08:08,240 --> 00:08:11,200
Never faltered against Japanese aggression.

103
00:08:11,320 --> 00:08:14,680
Never faltered in the Korean War.

104
00:08:15,920 --> 00:08:18,560
We certainly cannot falter today.

105
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:28,800
Hear my command. All companies, head back!

106
00:08:29,120 --> 00:08:30,920
Organize training according to plan.

107
00:08:31,480 --> 00:08:32,960
Fix your weaknesses.

108
00:08:33,640 --> 00:08:35,039
And hone your skills.

109
00:08:35,039 --> 00:08:36,080
Yes, sir!

110
00:08:36,559 --> 00:08:37,960
Left face!

111
00:08:38,520 --> 00:08:40,799
Column left, double time, march!

112
00:08:55,320 --> 00:08:56,200
Today,

113
00:08:56,840 --> 00:08:59,440
I was moved by the actions of the 1st Battalion's men.

114
00:09:00,800 --> 00:09:01,760
I never knew

115
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:04,560
that comradeship could take on

116
00:09:04,560 --> 00:09:06,640
such an almost unreasonable form.

117
00:09:08,400 --> 00:09:09,560
The 1st Battalion won't fall.

118
00:09:10,360 --> 00:09:13,280
Such a unit needs no hand-holding or reprimanding.

119
00:09:14,640 --> 00:09:15,960
I may not know

120
00:09:15,960 --> 00:09:17,840
where this unit gets its confidence,

121
00:09:18,320 --> 00:09:19,720
but from that moment on,

122
00:09:19,800 --> 00:09:20,720
I firmly believe

123
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:23,480
that a unit with such deep bonds

124
00:09:23,640 --> 00:09:25,840
will be especially favored by heaven.

125
00:09:38,440 --> 00:09:39,160
Squad Leader Wu.

126
00:09:40,200 --> 00:09:41,160
I've asked around.

127
00:09:41,880 --> 00:09:43,320
The surgeon operating on you today

128
00:09:43,320 --> 00:09:45,160
is the top expert in the entire army.

129
00:09:46,160 --> 00:09:47,320
An expert...

130
00:09:48,640 --> 00:09:50,560
Can they save my leg?

131
00:09:57,040 --> 00:09:57,800
Staff Officer Liang.

132
00:10:00,400 --> 00:10:02,280
What was the result of the exercise?

133
00:10:04,200 --> 00:10:05,280
Did we win?

134
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:32,680
Get out.

135
00:10:33,160 --> 00:10:34,720
All of you, get out!

136
00:10:35,080 --> 00:10:36,880
Squad Leader Wu, calm down. Take it easy.

137
00:10:36,880 --> 00:10:38,680
I don't believe it.

138
00:10:40,520 --> 00:10:41,320
Everybody out.

139
00:10:41,320 --> 00:10:41,880
What's going on?

140
00:10:41,880 --> 00:10:43,160
Everybody out!

141
00:10:43,160 --> 00:10:44,640
He asked me how the exercise went.

142
00:10:46,880 --> 00:10:48,400
He's about to go into surgery.

143
00:10:48,560 --> 00:10:50,000
Why would you tell him that now?

144
00:10:51,800 --> 00:10:53,040
Wu Dongsheng doesn't need your blood.

145
00:10:53,400 --> 00:10:53,880
Let's go.

146
00:11:04,040 --> 00:11:05,880
Battalion Commander Guo, surgery is starting soon.

147
00:11:05,880 --> 00:11:06,920
Please go talk to him.

148
00:11:25,480 --> 00:11:26,240
Battalion Commander.

149
00:11:27,680 --> 00:11:28,960
I'm fine now.

150
00:11:31,480 --> 00:11:32,840
I just...

151
00:11:34,560 --> 00:11:37,200
want to say goodbye to my Golden Right Foot.

152
00:11:40,840 --> 00:11:42,600
I've been a soldier for fifteen years.

153
00:11:44,200 --> 00:11:46,280
During every military exercise,

154
00:11:47,400 --> 00:11:48,520
I've pretty much

155
00:11:49,600 --> 00:11:51,200
been the one leading the charge.

156
00:11:54,800 --> 00:11:55,840
This time,

157
00:11:58,240 --> 00:12:01,400
just consider it my final charge.

158
00:12:06,200 --> 00:12:07,000
Battalion Commander,

159
00:12:09,800 --> 00:12:10,640
let's do it.

160
00:12:12,200 --> 00:12:13,520
I'm ready.

161
00:12:22,200 --> 00:12:23,040
I'll stay with you.

162
00:12:29,240 --> 00:12:31,080
Such a loyal and righteous unit...

163
00:12:31,960 --> 00:12:33,200
is a blessing for us.

164
00:12:35,960 --> 00:12:37,440
Though their methods shouldn't be encouraged,

165
00:12:38,440 --> 00:12:40,640
such sentiment should be cultivated.

166
00:12:42,240 --> 00:12:42,760
Commissar.

167
00:12:43,600 --> 00:12:44,480
Loyalty and righteousness

168
00:12:45,440 --> 00:12:46,240
have always been

169
00:12:47,000 --> 00:12:48,720
our battalion's fine tradition.

170
00:12:52,920 --> 00:12:54,320
Did Wu Dongsheng's surgery go well?

171
00:12:54,760 --> 00:12:56,320
So far, it's gone smoothly.

172
00:12:57,440 --> 00:12:58,200
What about his family?

173
00:12:59,080 --> 00:13:00,320
Wu Dongsheng is a very filial son.

174
00:13:01,280 --> 00:13:03,040
He absolutely refused to let us notify them.

175
00:13:04,400 --> 00:13:06,200
His parents must be quite old,

176
00:13:06,480 --> 00:13:08,120
and their health has never been great.

177
00:13:08,800 --> 00:13:10,560
Guo Zijian has been looking after him at the hospital.

178
00:13:13,240 --> 00:13:14,360
This Guo Zijian...

179
00:13:14,360 --> 00:13:15,880
is quite emotional right now.

180
00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:17,960
Letting him clear his head

181
00:13:17,960 --> 00:13:19,320
and cool down isn't a bad idea.

182
00:13:21,560 --> 00:13:22,600
It's just that there's no way

183
00:13:23,240 --> 00:13:24,440
to explain this to his parents.

184
00:13:25,720 --> 00:13:27,400
Originally, after this exercise,

185
00:13:28,040 --> 00:13:29,880
Wu Dongsheng was to become a Master Sergeant.

186
00:13:30,800 --> 00:13:32,320
He could have stayed in the army for good.

187
00:13:33,040 --> 00:13:34,720
But suddenly, this happened,

188
00:13:36,280 --> 00:13:37,680
and he lost a leg.

189
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:39,560
If

190
00:13:41,480 --> 00:13:42,440
we really just

191
00:13:43,640 --> 00:13:44,840
let him leave the army like this,

192
00:13:45,480 --> 00:13:47,040
as his leaders,

193
00:13:48,240 --> 00:13:49,960
shouldn't we give his family

194
00:13:50,880 --> 00:13:52,000
a satisfactory explanation?

195
00:13:54,040 --> 00:13:55,600
Just say what's on your mind.

196
00:13:55,840 --> 00:13:56,520
I ask the Commissar

197
00:13:56,720 --> 00:13:57,960
to request a citation for Wu Dongsheng.

198
00:14:01,560 --> 00:14:02,320
This matter

199
00:14:02,800 --> 00:14:03,480
is very complicated.

200
00:14:04,400 --> 00:14:04,840
First of all,

201
00:14:05,560 --> 00:14:06,840
a higher-level award

202
00:14:06,840 --> 00:14:07,800
can't be decided by our brigade.

203
00:14:07,880 --> 00:14:09,440
Second, even if it could,

204
00:14:10,800 --> 00:14:12,360
it wouldn't be that simple to execute.

205
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:16,840
Let me sound out our superiors' intentions first.

206
00:14:17,480 --> 00:14:19,840
The key still lies in the intel they transmitted.

207
00:14:19,880 --> 00:14:21,440
I ask the Commissar to request a citation for Wu Dongsheng.

208
00:14:58,040 --> 00:14:58,760
Does it hurt?

209
00:15:00,480 --> 00:15:02,280
Even though they used anesthesia,

210
00:15:04,520 --> 00:15:06,360
during the surgery,

211
00:15:10,520 --> 00:15:12,760
I felt completely awake.

212
00:15:18,320 --> 00:15:19,920
You know what,

213
00:15:22,440 --> 00:15:24,520
for us recon soldiers,

214
00:15:26,360 --> 00:15:28,040
our regular training

215
00:15:30,480 --> 00:15:31,680
at crucial moments,

216
00:15:33,280 --> 00:15:35,680
really comes in handy.

217
00:15:38,040 --> 00:15:38,640
Yeah.

218
00:15:41,960 --> 00:15:43,320
Ordinary anesthetics

219
00:15:44,880 --> 00:15:46,440
can't numb your willpower.

220
00:15:47,160 --> 00:15:48,480
It didn't hurt,

221
00:15:51,760 --> 00:15:52,800
but I...

222
00:15:54,880 --> 00:15:57,440
could clearly feel

223
00:16:01,600 --> 00:16:02,920
my foot,

224
00:16:05,640 --> 00:16:07,440
my Golden Right Foot,

225
00:16:09,160 --> 00:16:10,800
just bit...

226
00:16:12,480 --> 00:16:14,400
by bit, slipping away.

227
00:16:23,080 --> 00:16:23,760
I'm just...

228
00:16:25,000 --> 00:16:26,680
just not quite used to it.

229
00:16:33,280 --> 00:16:33,760
Battalion Commander,

230
00:16:35,720 --> 00:16:37,960
I can proudly tell you,

231
00:16:38,560 --> 00:16:39,720
any of those

232
00:16:40,400 --> 00:16:42,200
who got a taste of my Golden Right Foot...

233
00:16:42,200 --> 00:16:45,040
those rookies who got kicked in the butt,

234
00:16:45,680 --> 00:16:47,520
most of them turned out great.

235
00:16:50,320 --> 00:16:51,680
The more they got kicked,

236
00:16:52,320 --> 00:16:54,240
the more successful they became.

237
00:16:54,720 --> 00:16:56,360
The ones who got kicked the most

238
00:16:56,880 --> 00:16:58,480
in the military skills competitions

239
00:16:58,840 --> 00:17:00,800
often even won gold medals.

240
00:17:03,040 --> 00:17:04,200
Yang Maolin,

241
00:17:04,720 --> 00:17:06,319
he is the perfect example.

242
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:07,880
Really.

243
00:17:08,440 --> 00:17:10,079
I need to from time to time...

244
00:17:10,079 --> 00:17:10,440
I'll just...

245
00:17:12,960 --> 00:17:13,640
I'll go find the doctor.

246
00:17:14,200 --> 00:17:14,880
Battalion Commander,

247
00:17:15,960 --> 00:17:16,720
it's okay.

248
00:17:17,760 --> 00:17:18,760
I'm alright now.

249
00:17:20,079 --> 00:17:21,480
I just wanted to...

250
00:17:22,040 --> 00:17:23,440
wanted to chat with you for a bit.

251
00:17:49,280 --> 00:17:50,360
Battalion Commander.

252
00:17:53,200 --> 00:17:54,560
I'm sorry.

253
00:17:56,760 --> 00:17:58,400
I failed the mission.

254
00:17:59,520 --> 00:18:01,360
And my promise to you.

255
00:18:02,880 --> 00:18:04,680
I'm the one who should be sorry.

256
00:18:08,520 --> 00:18:09,560
Throughout the entire mission,

257
00:18:10,720 --> 00:18:12,200
from start to finish,

258
00:18:12,720 --> 00:18:14,720
you were executing my personal orders.

259
00:18:14,920 --> 00:18:15,800
No.

260
00:18:17,760 --> 00:18:18,560
Battalion Commander.

261
00:18:20,560 --> 00:18:22,520
You're the Military Commander.

262
00:18:23,160 --> 00:18:24,640
What I executed

263
00:18:25,640 --> 00:18:28,240
were combat orders from the battalion command.

264
00:18:29,160 --> 00:18:32,320
They were never just your personal requests.

265
00:18:34,720 --> 00:18:35,440
Besides,

266
00:18:37,080 --> 00:18:39,280
in all my years as a soldier,

267
00:18:40,640 --> 00:18:41,640
this mission

268
00:18:42,640 --> 00:18:44,600
was the most satisfying.

269
00:18:44,880 --> 00:18:47,400
And the closest thing to actual combat.

270
00:18:47,480 --> 00:18:48,760
Really.

271
00:18:48,960 --> 00:18:49,680
It was thrilling.

272
00:18:51,120 --> 00:18:51,800
Battalion Commander,

273
00:18:52,600 --> 00:18:54,440
this time, I, Wu Dongsheng,

274
00:18:56,200 --> 00:18:59,120
finally lived up to the title of King of Soldiers.

275
00:19:11,440 --> 00:19:12,200
Dongsheng,

276
00:19:13,320 --> 00:19:15,080
you will always be our 1st Battalion's

277
00:19:16,560 --> 00:19:18,080
well-deserved King of Soldiers.

278
00:19:20,040 --> 00:19:21,160
As for the future,

279
00:19:21,760 --> 00:19:22,880
you don't need to worry.

280
00:19:23,400 --> 00:19:25,160
I'll make sure everything is arranged for you.

281
00:19:27,040 --> 00:19:28,440
You won't be treated unfairly.

282
00:19:29,760 --> 00:19:30,640
Battalion Commander,

283
00:19:34,400 --> 00:19:35,680
I actually know

284
00:19:36,960 --> 00:19:39,000
that in my situation,

285
00:19:40,560 --> 00:19:43,280
it's hard to apply for a citation or anything.

286
00:19:44,160 --> 00:19:45,800
Don't blame Staff Officer Liang either.

287
00:19:47,640 --> 00:19:50,160
For her to tell me the truth at that time,

288
00:19:50,760 --> 00:19:52,520
I'm really quite grateful to her.

289
00:19:56,040 --> 00:19:57,680
During the surgery,

290
00:19:59,600 --> 00:20:01,240
I thought a lot.

291
00:20:03,160 --> 00:20:04,960
After leaving the army,

292
00:20:06,480 --> 00:20:08,560
I plan to open a repair shop.

293
00:20:09,280 --> 00:20:10,440
Fixing cars,

294
00:20:11,000 --> 00:20:12,120
fixing home appliances,

295
00:20:13,040 --> 00:20:14,600
I can fix anything.

296
00:20:16,960 --> 00:20:18,240
I let you down.

297
00:20:20,240 --> 00:20:22,040
You didn't let me down.

298
00:20:27,160 --> 00:20:28,320
Fight back!

299
00:20:29,960 --> 00:20:31,760
You're the army's competition champion!

300
00:20:32,880 --> 00:20:34,800
Squad Leader Wu valued you the most.

301
00:20:35,120 --> 00:20:36,680
He guided you the most with his Golden Right Foot!

302
00:20:36,680 --> 00:20:38,720
And you? What about you?

303
00:20:39,320 --> 00:20:41,200
You made him lose his Golden Right Foot!

304
00:20:43,000 --> 00:20:44,720
Is this how you repay him?

305
00:20:48,400 --> 00:20:49,320
Get up!

306
00:20:50,560 --> 00:20:51,560
What are you guys doing?

307
00:20:51,640 --> 00:20:52,960
What's with all the racket?

308
00:20:53,480 --> 00:20:54,360
They were fighting.

309
00:20:54,560 --> 00:20:55,560
No, we weren't.

310
00:20:56,760 --> 00:20:59,160
I just accidentally slipped and fell.

311
00:20:59,160 --> 00:21:00,400
This is a hospital.

312
00:21:00,400 --> 00:21:01,560
Mind your behavior.

313
00:21:05,920 --> 00:21:06,880
I'll go out and take a look.

314
00:21:19,760 --> 00:21:20,520
Lin Yihu!

315
00:21:27,120 --> 00:21:28,080
What are you doing?

316
00:21:31,360 --> 00:21:32,320
Battalion Commander Guo.

317
00:21:36,680 --> 00:21:37,640
I beg you.

318
00:21:38,000 --> 00:21:39,400
Let me see Squad Leader Wu.

319
00:22:18,440 --> 00:22:19,360
Enough already!

320
00:22:20,000 --> 00:22:21,160
He's the one who got the Squad Leader hurt.

321
00:22:21,280 --> 00:22:22,400
Why did you let him in?

322
00:22:22,960 --> 00:22:24,560
Will beating him up solve anything?

323
00:22:37,440 --> 00:22:38,640
Why are you following me?

324
00:22:39,040 --> 00:22:40,240
Stay and take care of your Squad Leader.

325
00:22:40,440 --> 00:22:41,360
Battalion Commander, what about you?

326
00:22:41,960 --> 00:22:44,760
I can't let Wu Dongsheng lose his right foot in vain.

327
00:23:12,280 --> 00:23:13,320
Come on, stop crying.

328
00:23:14,600 --> 00:23:15,560
If you keep crying,

329
00:23:17,920 --> 00:23:20,880
watch out, I'll kick you with my Golden Right Foot.

330
00:23:22,680 --> 00:23:23,280
Squad Leader.

331
00:23:25,040 --> 00:23:27,040
Just slap me a few times to let it out.

332
00:23:27,920 --> 00:23:28,720
Nonsense.

333
00:23:31,040 --> 00:23:32,520
Watching you improve

334
00:23:33,600 --> 00:23:35,040
makes me happier than anyone.

335
00:23:36,560 --> 00:23:38,400
Then my Golden Right Foot

336
00:23:40,080 --> 00:23:41,400
didn't take care of you for nothing.

337
00:23:42,920 --> 00:23:43,560
Squad Leader.

338
00:23:44,080 --> 00:23:45,120
Wherever you go from now on,

339
00:23:45,760 --> 00:23:46,880
I'll go with you.

340
00:23:47,560 --> 00:23:48,880
I'll be your legs.

341
00:23:50,320 --> 00:23:51,880
That's just nonsense.

342
00:23:55,000 --> 00:23:57,200
If you really feel you owe me,

343
00:24:00,920 --> 00:24:02,800
then promise me one thing.

344
00:24:07,160 --> 00:24:08,200
Name it, Squad Leader.

345
00:24:10,120 --> 00:24:11,800
Listen closely.

346
00:24:14,000 --> 00:24:16,400
I want you

347
00:24:17,800 --> 00:24:20,160
to give the 1st Battalion back a King of Soldiers.

348
00:24:33,600 --> 00:24:34,200
Old Sang,

349
00:24:35,280 --> 00:24:36,320
about Wu Dongsheng,

350
00:24:36,320 --> 00:24:37,560
what did the brigade actually say?

351
00:24:37,760 --> 00:24:38,960
The brigade leaders are in a tough spot too.

352
00:24:38,960 --> 00:24:40,200
They're holding a Party Committee Meeting to discuss it.

353
00:24:40,280 --> 00:24:40,640
I took Wu Dongsheng's file...

354
00:24:40,640 --> 00:24:41,960
What's so tough about it?

355
00:24:42,760 --> 00:24:43,840
Guo Zijian!

356
00:24:45,040 --> 00:24:45,920
Guo Zijian!

357
00:24:47,520 --> 00:24:48,680
Guo Zijian!

358
00:24:53,760 --> 00:24:54,600
Guo Zijian!

359
00:24:56,720 --> 00:24:57,400
Comrades,

360
00:24:57,960 --> 00:24:59,080
this standing committee meeting

361
00:24:59,400 --> 00:25:00,640
has two main agenda items.

362
00:25:01,240 --> 00:25:01,680
First,

363
00:25:02,160 --> 00:25:03,240
regarding this recent exercise,

364
00:25:03,240 --> 00:25:04,320
we must look at the exposed problems

365
00:25:04,520 --> 00:25:06,160
and deeply reflect on them

366
00:25:06,560 --> 00:25:08,800
to identify our shortcomings and catch up.

367
00:25:09,760 --> 00:25:10,400
Second,

368
00:25:11,000 --> 00:25:12,400
is to address Comrade Guo Zijian's

369
00:25:12,400 --> 00:25:15,360
disciplinary violations during the exercise,

370
00:25:15,920 --> 00:25:17,040
and decide on a course of action.

371
00:25:18,440 --> 00:25:19,360
I'll speak first.

372
00:25:21,040 --> 00:25:23,080
First, I'd like to talk about

373
00:25:23,160 --> 00:25:24,640
this recent exercise,

374
00:25:25,160 --> 00:25:27,640
specifically our brigade's wartime logistics support

375
00:25:27,760 --> 00:25:30,280
and its four prominent issues.

376
00:25:30,680 --> 00:25:31,360
Battalion Commander Guo,

377
00:25:31,360 --> 00:25:33,720
this meeting is for the brigade's standing committee.

378
00:25:33,720 --> 00:25:35,480
You're not on the list. You can't enter.

379
00:25:35,480 --> 00:25:36,760
I'm not asking to join the meeting.

380
00:25:36,760 --> 00:25:37,760
I just have one request.

381
00:25:37,760 --> 00:25:38,560
Five minutes is all I need.

382
00:25:38,560 --> 00:25:39,480
Discipline is discipline.

383
00:25:39,480 --> 00:25:40,440
Let alone five minutes,

384
00:25:40,440 --> 00:25:41,400
I can't even give you one.

385
00:25:41,400 --> 00:25:42,080
Why won't you listen?

386
00:25:42,840 --> 00:25:43,520
You're the one not listening!

387
00:25:43,800 --> 00:25:44,800
You cannot go in.

388
00:25:44,800 --> 00:25:45,280
Enough.

389
00:25:45,280 --> 00:25:45,680
You!

390
00:25:47,400 --> 00:25:49,040
Commander, look at him.

391
00:25:52,280 --> 00:25:53,120
Let him in.

392
00:25:54,440 --> 00:25:56,600
We'll make an exception at today's Party Committee Meeting.

393
00:25:57,280 --> 00:25:58,800
Give Battalion Commander Guo a few minutes.

394
00:25:58,960 --> 00:26:00,480
The Party Committee Meeting is paused.

395
00:26:00,680 --> 00:26:02,160
We will continue after he's done.

396
00:26:13,440 --> 00:26:14,360
Commanders,

397
00:26:15,280 --> 00:26:17,000
I know that interrupting the Party Committee meeting

398
00:26:17,360 --> 00:26:18,440
has serious consequences.

399
00:26:19,080 --> 00:26:20,400
You can punish me however you see fit.

400
00:26:22,040 --> 00:26:23,320
But regarding the matter at hand,

401
00:26:23,920 --> 00:26:25,240
I ask you, commanders,

402
00:26:25,680 --> 00:26:27,040
to finalize it as soon as possible.

403
00:26:28,040 --> 00:26:29,760
Just say what you need to say.

404
00:26:30,400 --> 00:26:31,200
In short,

405
00:26:31,920 --> 00:26:33,960
request a citation for Wu Dongsheng.

406
00:26:37,560 --> 00:26:39,360
Regarding the issue of requesting a citation for Wu Dongsheng,

407
00:26:39,920 --> 00:26:42,600
Comrade Sang Haitian, Party Secretary of the 1st Battalion,

408
00:26:43,360 --> 00:26:44,600
has already reported it to me.

409
00:26:44,720 --> 00:26:46,680
We will act according to relevant regulations and policies

410
00:26:47,160 --> 00:26:48,160
to consider it comprehensively.

411
00:26:49,200 --> 00:26:50,600
There is absolutely no need for you

412
00:26:51,120 --> 00:26:53,600
to bring it up at the brigade's Party Committee meeting.

413
00:26:55,320 --> 00:26:56,240
Wu Dongsheng's

414
00:26:56,800 --> 00:26:58,040
injury resulting in disability,

415
00:26:58,520 --> 00:26:59,400
if we look into it,

416
00:27:00,720 --> 00:27:02,000
from beginning to end,

417
00:27:02,160 --> 00:27:04,560
was a severe violation of exercise discipline.

418
00:27:04,800 --> 00:27:05,960
Deploying troops without authorization

419
00:27:06,280 --> 00:27:07,640
caused an accountability incident.

420
00:27:08,280 --> 00:27:09,320
As the Battalion Commander,

421
00:27:09,600 --> 00:27:10,800
you cannot shirk the blame.

422
00:27:11,680 --> 00:27:13,080
As for your disciplinary action,

423
00:27:13,240 --> 00:27:14,320
we are currently discussing it.

424
00:27:15,120 --> 00:27:16,280
Yet you ran over here

425
00:27:16,400 --> 00:27:17,480
to claim credit and ask for a reward for him.

426
00:27:18,600 --> 00:27:19,760
What is going through your head?

427
00:27:19,960 --> 00:27:21,040
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo.

428
00:27:21,720 --> 00:27:23,840
Deal with my issue however you must.

429
00:27:24,960 --> 00:27:26,120
But I beg you,

430
00:27:26,520 --> 00:27:29,000
for the sake of a veteran who risked his life in combat,

431
00:27:29,960 --> 00:27:31,440
request a citation for him.

432
00:27:31,600 --> 00:27:33,040
Risked his life in combat?

433
00:27:33,040 --> 00:27:34,200
You make it sound so noble.

434
00:27:34,880 --> 00:27:36,280
I will reiterate it once more.

435
00:27:36,720 --> 00:27:38,440
This matter, from beginning to end,

436
00:27:38,520 --> 00:27:39,560
is entirely

437
00:27:39,840 --> 00:27:41,440
a severe accountability incident.

438
00:27:42,720 --> 00:27:44,280
By using these fancy words

439
00:27:44,480 --> 00:27:45,440
to dress it up,

440
00:27:45,960 --> 00:27:47,640
can you change the nature of the incident?

441
00:27:47,920 --> 00:27:50,080
Officer Li, have you seen Guo Zijian?

442
00:27:51,080 --> 00:27:53,360
Even if it's deemed an accountability incident,

443
00:27:53,720 --> 00:27:54,960
it's my responsibility,

444
00:27:55,000 --> 00:27:56,040
not his responsibility.

445
00:27:56,400 --> 00:27:57,840
He was just following orders.

446
00:27:58,640 --> 00:28:00,520
Throughout the entire mission,

447
00:28:01,040 --> 00:28:02,560
what Wu Dongsheng demonstrated was

448
00:28:02,760 --> 00:28:04,680
a fearless spirit of sacrifice.

449
00:28:04,960 --> 00:28:05,680
Furthermore...

450
00:28:05,680 --> 00:28:06,640
Comrade Guo Zijian,

451
00:28:07,320 --> 00:28:08,920
today's Party Committee meeting is very important.

452
00:28:09,240 --> 00:28:10,000
Step outside first.

453
00:28:10,640 --> 00:28:11,600
Regarding this matter,

454
00:28:12,080 --> 00:28:13,640
we'll talk about it after the meeting ends.

455
00:28:13,800 --> 00:28:14,560
Commissar,

456
00:28:15,080 --> 00:28:17,280
I knew today was the Party Committee meeting,

457
00:28:17,280 --> 00:28:18,080
that's exactly why I came.

458
00:28:18,960 --> 00:28:20,360
If I wait until the meeting ends,

459
00:28:20,680 --> 00:28:22,920
there will be no hope for Wu Dongsheng's case.

460
00:28:24,680 --> 00:28:26,040
I'm begging you, leaders.

461
00:28:28,120 --> 00:28:28,800
Guo Zijian!

462
00:28:29,760 --> 00:28:31,120
Do you even act like a Battalion Commander?

463
00:28:31,600 --> 00:28:32,200
Get out!

464
00:28:33,240 --> 00:28:35,200
As long as you request a citation for Wu Dongsheng,

465
00:28:36,320 --> 00:28:38,440
even if you dismiss me as Battalion Commander,

466
00:28:38,760 --> 00:28:40,280
even if you make me transfer to civilian work,

467
00:28:40,480 --> 00:28:41,760
I will have no complaints.

468
00:28:41,960 --> 00:28:43,560
What kind of place do you think the army is?

469
00:28:45,600 --> 00:28:46,840
Can military honors

470
00:28:47,040 --> 00:28:48,360
be traded like commodities?

471
00:28:51,320 --> 00:28:52,800
I beg you, leaders,

472
00:28:53,320 --> 00:28:55,800
even if just out of humanitarian spirit,

473
00:28:56,200 --> 00:28:58,760
please request a citation for Wu Dongsheng.

474
00:28:59,600 --> 00:29:00,640
According to you,

475
00:29:00,720 --> 00:29:02,120
if we don't request a citation for him today,

476
00:29:02,200 --> 00:29:03,400
does that make us inhumane?

477
00:29:07,000 --> 00:29:07,840
I'm telling you,

478
00:29:08,760 --> 00:29:09,640
Wu Dongsheng

479
00:29:10,720 --> 00:29:11,880
will absolutely not get a citation.

480
00:29:13,400 --> 00:29:14,680
Not even a commendation.

481
00:29:17,880 --> 00:29:20,000
If I can't even protect my own soldier,

482
00:29:22,040 --> 00:29:23,680
what use am I as a Battalion Commander?

483
00:29:25,800 --> 00:29:26,560
I quit!

484
00:29:26,880 --> 00:29:27,760
You quit?

485
00:29:27,760 --> 00:29:28,720
Oh my God.

486
00:29:29,800 --> 00:29:31,120
You've caused a massive disaster.

487
00:29:31,120 --> 00:29:31,960
Let me tell you,

488
00:29:32,520 --> 00:29:33,880
the Party Committee is meeting today

489
00:29:33,880 --> 00:29:36,280
to discuss your disciplinary action.

490
00:29:37,600 --> 00:29:39,000
Even if you want to stay,

491
00:29:40,080 --> 00:29:41,760
you might not get the chance.

492
00:29:47,200 --> 00:29:48,400
If that's the case,

493
00:29:49,880 --> 00:29:51,520
then I have nothing left to say.

494
00:30:09,920 --> 00:30:11,120
Commanders, I'm sorry.

495
00:30:12,440 --> 00:30:13,120
He left. This...

496
00:30:27,960 --> 00:30:29,240
Comrade Baoping,

497
00:30:32,320 --> 00:30:33,200
you're the Commissar,

498
00:30:35,320 --> 00:30:36,200
the Party Secretary.

499
00:30:38,080 --> 00:30:39,120
You decide.

500
00:30:41,640 --> 00:30:42,120
Alright.

501
00:30:48,400 --> 00:30:49,840
Since Guo Zijian

502
00:30:50,440 --> 00:30:53,000
is a topic we can't avoid today,

503
00:30:53,440 --> 00:30:54,000
then fine,

504
00:30:54,520 --> 00:30:55,720
we'll strike while the iron is hot

505
00:30:57,000 --> 00:30:59,360
and specifically discuss his case.

506
00:31:00,840 --> 00:31:01,600
Comrade Dongfang,

507
00:31:02,240 --> 00:31:02,960
you speak first.

508
00:31:05,360 --> 00:31:06,240
Guo Zijian,

509
00:31:06,240 --> 00:31:08,120
what exactly are you playing at?

510
00:31:08,680 --> 00:31:10,160
There was still hope for this,

511
00:31:10,160 --> 00:31:11,080
but you just had to interfere

512
00:31:11,080 --> 00:31:12,400
and ruin it completely.

513
00:31:12,400 --> 00:31:13,320
Hope my ass!

514
00:31:13,800 --> 00:31:14,960
If you won't fight for it,

515
00:31:15,000 --> 00:31:16,280
what's the use of talking nonsense with me?

516
00:31:16,320 --> 00:31:17,640
Swallowed gunpowder?

517
00:31:17,680 --> 00:31:19,600
Even so, you can't just snap at everyone!

518
00:31:19,920 --> 00:31:21,360
Fine, I won't waste my breath on you.

519
00:31:21,760 --> 00:31:23,400
I don't need to wait for them to punish me.

520
00:31:23,400 --> 00:31:24,960
I'll submit a report to transfer to civilian work.

521
00:31:25,040 --> 00:31:26,320
At worst, I'll go start a business

522
00:31:26,320 --> 00:31:27,360
and support Wu Dongsheng for life.

523
00:31:27,360 --> 00:31:29,560
Guo Zijian, calm down!

524
00:31:30,520 --> 00:31:31,000
Calm down?

525
00:31:32,080 --> 00:31:33,440
How can I calm down?

526
00:31:35,880 --> 00:31:37,480
You didn't see Wu Dongsheng.

527
00:31:38,560 --> 00:31:40,000
His foot is gone.

528
00:31:40,680 --> 00:31:42,560
His Golden Right Foot is gone.

529
00:31:46,800 --> 00:31:48,160
With his abilities,

530
00:31:48,280 --> 00:31:49,880
he could have stayed in the military long-term.

531
00:31:50,360 --> 00:31:52,360
His wife and kids could have joined him here.

532
00:31:53,320 --> 00:31:54,240
But now?

533
00:31:54,600 --> 00:31:55,880
Everything is gone.

534
00:31:57,640 --> 00:31:59,240
How is he supposed to support his family

535
00:31:59,640 --> 00:32:00,760
and make a living from now on?

536
00:32:07,360 --> 00:32:08,880
A lifetime is very long.

537
00:32:09,600 --> 00:32:11,920
You know? Very long.

538
00:32:19,760 --> 00:32:21,080
They were right.

539
00:32:22,520 --> 00:32:24,000
All the responsibility falls on me.

540
00:32:26,040 --> 00:32:27,600
I need to take this responsibility.

541
00:34:25,600 --> 00:34:27,400
After leaving the army,

542
00:34:28,800 --> 00:34:31,199
I'm planning to open a repair shop.

543
00:34:32,199 --> 00:34:35,000
Fixing cars, home appliances...

544
00:34:36,080 --> 00:34:37,400
I can fix anything.

545
00:34:46,480 --> 00:34:47,840
I am officially telling you,

546
00:34:48,920 --> 00:34:49,880
Wu Dongsheng

547
00:34:51,360 --> 00:34:52,320
will not receive a citation,

548
00:34:53,520 --> 00:34:54,760
nor will he be commended.

549
00:35:19,600 --> 00:35:20,880
Guo Zijian got into trouble again.

550
00:35:22,200 --> 00:35:23,040
I can't believe him.

551
00:35:23,320 --> 00:35:24,480
He crashed the Party Committee Meeting.

552
00:35:24,480 --> 00:35:25,880
Said he wanted to request a citation for the injured

553
00:35:25,880 --> 00:35:27,520
Reconnaissance Squad Leader, Wu Dongsheng.

554
00:35:28,240 --> 00:35:29,320
What he did isn't exactly a huge deal,

555
00:35:29,360 --> 00:35:30,080
but it's not a small matter either.

556
00:35:31,200 --> 00:35:32,880
It's his soldier after all, so it's understandable.

557
00:35:33,360 --> 00:35:34,640
Let me remind you,

558
00:35:34,640 --> 00:35:35,960
when it comes to Guo Zijian's issue,

559
00:35:35,960 --> 00:35:37,640
we're both in a sensitive position.

560
00:35:37,640 --> 00:35:39,040
We absolutely cannot get involved.

561
00:35:39,920 --> 00:35:40,640
I'm well aware.

562
00:35:53,960 --> 00:35:54,480
Halt.

563
00:35:56,440 --> 00:35:57,120
Commissar.

564
00:35:58,240 --> 00:35:59,160
Where are you going?

565
00:35:59,960 --> 00:36:00,840
Haven't you caused enough trouble?

566
00:36:03,560 --> 00:36:04,760
This is my report for transfer to civilian work.

567
00:36:16,440 --> 00:36:17,760
The Party Committee Meeting

568
00:36:17,760 --> 00:36:19,320
has already made a decision.

569
00:36:19,960 --> 00:36:21,680
Starting tomorrow, you are suspended from duty,

570
00:36:22,280 --> 00:36:23,480
pending the final decision.

571
00:36:24,040 --> 00:36:26,320
I suggest you take some leave and think it over.

572
00:36:27,240 --> 00:36:29,040
I'll hold on to this for now.

573
00:36:42,160 --> 00:36:45,240
Here's the reflection and summary of the exercise.

574
00:36:46,520 --> 00:36:48,840
And these are my personal

575
00:36:48,960 --> 00:36:50,760
thoughts on this exercise.

576
00:36:52,520 --> 00:36:54,080
Never mind. They're probably useless anyway.

577
00:36:54,800 --> 00:36:56,560
What do you mean they're useless?

578
00:36:56,760 --> 00:36:58,040
This is such valuable information.

579
00:36:58,280 --> 00:36:59,000
I'm keeping it all.

580
00:36:59,880 --> 00:37:00,760
Suit yourself.

581
00:37:02,080 --> 00:37:03,720
I won't be needing it anymore anyway.

582
00:37:03,920 --> 00:37:05,320
I'm sure you will.

583
00:37:07,960 --> 00:37:09,200
This leave application,

584
00:37:09,520 --> 00:37:10,920
you've reviewed it several times.

585
00:37:11,680 --> 00:37:13,080
It's even stamped with

586
00:37:13,600 --> 00:37:14,720
the brigade's Human Resources Department

587
00:37:15,520 --> 00:37:17,600
and Political Work Department's big red seals.

588
00:37:18,000 --> 00:37:19,000
Battalion Commander,

589
00:37:19,880 --> 00:37:21,200
I think this matter

590
00:37:21,560 --> 00:37:23,040
hasn't reached the worst-case scenario yet.

591
00:37:24,000 --> 00:37:24,840
Right now, we actually...

592
00:37:24,840 --> 00:37:25,480
All right, all right.

593
00:37:26,280 --> 00:37:27,560
You don't need to say anything.

594
00:37:29,040 --> 00:37:30,480
My mind is a mess right now.

595
00:37:31,440 --> 00:37:32,800
I need to be alone to sort things out.

596
00:37:32,920 --> 00:37:34,240
But there's no time right now

597
00:37:34,240 --> 00:37:35,360
for you to sort things out.

598
00:37:36,720 --> 00:37:38,080
The exercise just ended.

599
00:37:39,040 --> 00:37:41,160
So many things in the battalion are waiting for you.

600
00:37:43,960 --> 00:37:44,600
Old Sang,

601
00:37:46,360 --> 00:37:47,160
Normally,

602
00:37:48,360 --> 00:37:50,320
playing the deserter at a critical juncture like this

603
00:37:51,480 --> 00:37:53,360
really isn't Guo Zijian's style.

604
00:37:54,280 --> 00:37:55,640
But since things have come to this,

605
00:37:56,040 --> 00:37:56,840
there's no other way.

606
00:37:58,240 --> 00:38:00,360
If I stay in the battalion now,

607
00:38:00,840 --> 00:38:03,080
I'll just be a nuisance to you and everyone else.

608
00:38:03,600 --> 00:38:04,360
There's no need for that.

609
00:38:09,840 --> 00:38:10,640
I know

610
00:38:12,280 --> 00:38:13,640
that my personality

611
00:38:14,560 --> 00:38:15,840
is quite unlikable.

612
00:38:16,960 --> 00:38:19,000
I never cared about what they thought before.

613
00:38:19,840 --> 00:38:20,640
All I wanted was

614
00:38:21,480 --> 00:38:23,360
to fight well and win.

615
00:38:24,480 --> 00:38:25,120
I believe

616
00:38:25,120 --> 00:38:27,960
that's the bounden duty of a military commander.

617
00:38:28,320 --> 00:38:29,880
Why overthink it?

618
00:38:31,640 --> 00:38:32,800
But through

619
00:38:33,280 --> 00:38:34,440
this recent incident,

620
00:38:34,960 --> 00:38:35,880
I've realized

621
00:38:36,480 --> 00:38:38,440
that relying solely on my own reckless bravery

622
00:38:38,960 --> 00:38:39,640
is useless.

623
00:38:40,880 --> 00:38:41,680
In the end,

624
00:38:42,400 --> 00:38:43,280
it just hurts others.

625
00:38:45,400 --> 00:38:46,240
So,

626
00:38:48,120 --> 00:38:49,200
from now on, the 1st Battalion

627
00:38:50,000 --> 00:38:50,920
is in your hands.

628
00:38:57,760 --> 00:38:58,440
Battalion Commander,

629
00:38:59,640 --> 00:39:00,960
the 1st Battalion's morale

630
00:39:02,560 --> 00:39:03,600
needs you.

631
00:39:05,040 --> 00:39:06,800
The 1st Battalion's future comeback

632
00:39:07,280 --> 00:39:08,480
needs you even more.

633
00:39:10,000 --> 00:39:11,240
I, Sang Haitian,

634
00:39:12,880 --> 00:39:14,200
from beginning to end,

635
00:39:19,600 --> 00:39:21,400
have never once felt you were a nuisance to me.

636
00:39:23,000 --> 00:39:25,520
Things really haven't reached the worst-case scenario.

637
00:39:26,360 --> 00:39:28,000
At a time like this, you cannot

638
00:39:29,720 --> 00:39:30,920
just say you give up.

639
00:39:31,480 --> 00:39:32,400
If I don't give up,

640
00:39:33,520 --> 00:39:34,960
do I have any other way out?

641
00:39:35,120 --> 00:39:35,760
Yes.

642
00:39:37,240 --> 00:39:38,520
Properly admit your mistakes,

643
00:39:38,520 --> 00:39:39,760
write a sincere self-criticism,

644
00:39:40,360 --> 00:39:42,080
and seek leniency from the organization.

645
00:39:46,200 --> 00:39:47,720
But was I really wrong?

646
00:39:48,720 --> 00:39:49,440
Are you saying

647
00:39:49,920 --> 00:39:51,360
I should write a self-criticism

648
00:39:51,560 --> 00:39:54,600
for wholeheartedly treating the exercise like real combat?

649
00:39:55,640 --> 00:39:57,760
For treating training like actual combat?

650
00:39:58,520 --> 00:40:01,040
For taking the intel's authenticity seriously

651
00:40:01,040 --> 00:40:02,120
and confronting the leadership?

652
00:40:02,280 --> 00:40:04,960
For sticking to the basic judgment

653
00:40:05,000 --> 00:40:06,360
of a military commander?

654
00:40:07,360 --> 00:40:10,360
Should I just focus on the grading criteria of the exercise

655
00:40:10,400 --> 00:40:11,880
to prepare for combat and train the troops?

656
00:40:13,560 --> 00:40:14,560
Let me tell you,

657
00:40:15,000 --> 00:40:16,240
I can't do that.

658
00:40:16,920 --> 00:40:18,160
And I absolutely won't allow

659
00:40:19,120 --> 00:40:20,240
our soldiers,

660
00:40:20,920 --> 00:40:22,320
who go through thick and thin with me,

661
00:40:22,320 --> 00:40:23,480
the hundreds of men in the battalion,

662
00:40:24,040 --> 00:40:25,680
covered in mud and sweat,

663
00:40:26,000 --> 00:40:27,080
to just run around aimlessly.

664
00:40:27,320 --> 00:40:29,960
To hustle year after year,

665
00:40:30,000 --> 00:40:32,200
only to never get anywhere near a battlefield.

666
00:40:35,000 --> 00:40:35,640
Yes,

667
00:40:36,720 --> 00:40:38,480
we are in peacetime now.

668
00:40:39,680 --> 00:40:41,800
But is this world really safe?

669
00:40:42,520 --> 00:40:44,720
I don't want our soldiers,

670
00:40:45,040 --> 00:40:47,360
when our national security is threatened,

671
00:40:47,360 --> 00:40:48,760
to have absolutely no combat effectiveness.

672
00:40:50,320 --> 00:40:51,080
Was I wrong?

673
00:41:00,000 --> 00:41:01,840
What an iron-blooded Battalion Commander.

674
00:41:03,280 --> 00:41:05,040
Just now you were telling me

675
00:41:05,760 --> 00:41:07,760
that you only had your solitary courage.

676
00:41:08,760 --> 00:41:10,000
And now you're in front of me

677
00:41:10,000 --> 00:41:11,680
making all these complaints.

678
00:41:13,200 --> 00:41:13,920
Battalion Commander.

679
00:41:15,280 --> 00:41:17,360
I remember very clearly.

680
00:41:17,960 --> 00:41:19,640
When you first came to our 1st Battalion,

681
00:41:20,400 --> 00:41:22,240
you told me yourself.

682
00:41:23,520 --> 00:41:26,160
You said war is about one word,

683
00:41:27,200 --> 00:41:28,000
and that is "win."

684
00:41:29,400 --> 00:41:31,280
Then why are we here today

685
00:41:31,280 --> 00:41:33,040
discussing right and wrong?

686
00:41:33,640 --> 00:41:35,280
I think what you said today

687
00:41:35,280 --> 00:41:36,760
shouldn't be directed at me.

688
00:41:38,080 --> 00:41:39,600
You should say it to yourself.

689
00:41:41,600 --> 00:41:43,440
You really should sort things out,

690
00:41:44,440 --> 00:41:46,200
and ask yourself carefully

691
00:41:47,520 --> 00:41:49,720
whether you view all problems right now

692
00:41:49,720 --> 00:41:51,280
solely from your own perspective.

693
00:41:53,040 --> 00:41:55,520
And when you look at all the problems,

694
00:41:55,840 --> 00:41:57,760
have you failed to find where your real problems

695
00:41:58,040 --> 00:41:59,560
and flaws are?

696
00:42:01,720 --> 00:42:03,080
Then tell me where they are!

697
00:42:03,080 --> 00:42:05,280
I don't care where they are!

698
00:42:06,680 --> 00:42:07,800
Let me tell you, Guo Zijian,

699
00:42:08,640 --> 00:42:10,240
if you can't figure it out yourself,

700
00:42:10,240 --> 00:42:11,680
no one can teach you.

701
00:42:13,000 --> 00:42:15,200
The 1st Battalion isn't yours to give to me.

702
00:42:16,200 --> 00:42:17,400
You don't have that authority.

703
00:42:18,440 --> 00:42:20,200
You clearly chose to take leave yourself.

704
00:42:21,040 --> 00:42:22,400
You really should find a place

705
00:42:22,400 --> 00:42:23,720
and sort yourself out.

706
00:42:25,240 --> 00:42:25,920
If one year isn't enough,

707
00:42:26,360 --> 00:42:27,000
take two.

708
00:42:27,440 --> 00:42:29,200
If two aren't enough, take a lifetime.

709
00:42:29,400 --> 00:42:31,920
If you can't sort it out, don't come back.

710
00:42:40,040 --> 00:42:40,720
Guo Zijian.

711
00:42:41,680 --> 00:42:42,120
Take care.

712
00:42:42,880 --> 00:42:43,560
I won't see you out.
